        "instructions": "### Goal\nImplement `isSuperkey(allAttrs, candidateAttrs, fds)` by testing whether the attribute closure of `candidateAttrs` equals the universal attribute set `allAttrs`.\n\n### Database Invariant\nTesting Whether X+ Covers All Relation Attributes R",
