        "concept": "Identifying Non-Trivial FDs X -> Y Where X Is Not a Superkey",
        "instructions": "### Goal\nImplement `findBcnfViolations(allAttrs, fds)` to return every non-trivial functional dependency $X \\to Y$ whose determinant $X$ is not a superkey of `allAttrs`.\n\n### Database Invariant\nIdentifying Non-Trivial FDs X -> Y Where X Is Not a Superkey",
