        "concept": "Avoiding Cross-Shard Fan-Out When the Partition Key Is Specified",
        "instructions": "### Goal\nImplement `planQuery(query)` to return `{ mode: \"SINGLE_SHARD\" | \"SCATTER_GATHER\", targetShards }`.\n\n### Database Invariant\nAvoiding Cross-Shard Fan-Out When the Partition Key Is Specified",
